sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Farmer as Farmer (PWA)
    participant Web as Next.js BFF (Vercel)
    participant DB as PostgreSQL (Supabase)
    participant Storage as Supabase Storage
    participant ML as FastAPI / ONNX (Render)

    Farmer->>Web: Selects Crop & Uploads Leaf Image
    Note over Web: Verify Origin & Auth Session
    Web->>DB: RPC reserve_diagnosis(request_key)
    DB-->>Web: Reservation ID (status: processing)
    Web->>Storage: Upload Image to crop-images/<owner>/<id>/image
    Storage-->>Web: 200 OK
    Web->>ML: POST /predict (Multipart Image, Crop Name, API Key)
    Note over ML: Decode, Resize 224x224, Normalize<br/>Run ONNX Inference (MobileNetV2)<br/>Crop-Conditioning & Mismatch Check
    ML-->>Web: 200 OK (Prediction, Top-5, Conditioned Probabilities, Warnings)
    Web->>DB: RPC finish_diagnosis(id, owner, result)
    DB->>DB: Verify Image Exists in Storage<br/>Update status: complete<br/>Insert top-5 into diagnosis_predictions
    DB-->>Web: 200 OK
    Web-->>Farmer: Render Diagnosis, Confidence Score & Multilingual Guidance
